            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">No. We back up your full source code before making any change and optimize on a copy. We verify everything works, then deploy — and if anything looks off we can roll back to the backup immediately.</p>
          </details>
          <details data-reveal class="faq-item group rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5">
            <summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold">What access do you need?<i class="ph-bold ph-caret-down transition group-open:rotate-180"></i></summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Just your website URL to start and run the audit. Once you approve the plan, we request access to your source code or CMS (hosting, admin or repository) so we can apply the optimizations and deploy.</p>
          </details>
          <details data-reveal class="faq-item group rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5">
            <summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold">How much improvement can I expect?<i class="ph-bold ph-caret-down transition group-open:rotate-180"></i></summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">After the audit we predict the realistic lift for your site and show it before we start. Typical results include large PageSpeed gains, passing Core Web Vitals and a higher technical SEO score — all documented in the before-and-after report you can verify yourself.</p>
          </details>
          <details data-reveal class="faq-item group rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5">
            <summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold">What does AI-ready / GEO optimization mean?<i class="ph-bold ph-caret-down transition group-open:rotate-180"></i></summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">GEO (Generative Engine Optimization) makes your content readable, citable and surfaceable by AI search and generative engines. We add structured data, strengthen entity and answer-ready content, and clean up markup so AI systems can understand and quote your pages. It's included from the Standard plan up.</p>
          </details>
          <details data-reveal class="faq-item group rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5">
            <summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold">Which platforms do you support?<i class="ph-bold ph-caret-down transition group-open:rotate-180"></i></summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">WordPress, custom-coded sites, headless and most common stacks. For large or unusual sites we run a Custom plan scoped to your codebase after the audit.</p>
          </details>
          <details data-reveal class="faq-item group rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5">
            <summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold">What happens after optimization?<i class="ph-bold ph-caret-down transition group-open:rotate-180"></i></summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">A faster, cleaner, AI-ready site is the foundation. To grow rankings further, many clients continue with our Content, Backlink and ongoing maintenance services — your specialist will suggest the best next step based on the audit.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
